WindowPane branding and persistent corner grip

Status: DONE
Milestone: Recognizable native icon and a reliable small drag/options anchor
Dependencies: 03_DESKTOP_CONTROLS.todo, 07_IN_PANE_RECOVERY.todo
Purpose: Brand the tool and keep pane interaction available without a title bar.

Tasks:
- [x] Generate original SVG/PNG logo and multi-size favicon/Windows ICO.
- [x] Embed branded executable/window/tray icons and inspect the rendered assets.
- [x] Add a frosted-look corner grip independent of captured-content transparency.
- [x] Wire grip dragging, snapping, options and visibility/picker lifecycle.
- [x] Qualify native input/lifecycle paths and public-safe visual references.
