Acceptance criteria:
- Icon resources load from the executable and brand the controls/tray.
- Grip moves the actual pane, follows its bounds and exposes its options.
- Transparent or click-through content cannot make the grip inaccessible.
- Hiding/snipping/picking does not leave an orphan grip or obstruct selection.
- Frosted styling is not misrepresented as live backdrop blur.
- No extra desktop capture, private imagery or runtime dependency.

